     "judge_reason": "The minimax and cubic mathematics are sound, but the primary calibration compares model and DFT absolute energies with incompatible reference origins. This invalidates its physical energy-error selection, materially changing the selected anchor: q=0 under the raw convention versus 0.0848 or 0.1356 under the disclosed endpoint-reference adjustments. This is a calibration-validity defect, not merely failure to improve performance.",
